---
import Author from '../Author.astro';
---

<div class="about-the-author py-4 border-b">
	<h3 class="font-extrabold uppercase mb-4 text-sm">
		About the Author
	</h3>

	<Author picSize="md" />

	<div class="author-desc text-[.825rem] my-4">
		<p class="mb-3">
			Bhupesh is a Computer Engineering student interested in
			database systems, C++, systems programming, and computer science.
			He writes and builds projects at
			<a
				href="https://bhupesh.com.np"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				class="underline"
			>
				bhupesh.com.np
			</a>.
		</p>

		<p>
			He enjoys building software from the ground up and exploring how
			computer systems work internally. He is currently building projects
			such as BinaryDB, a minimal page-based NoSQL document database in C++.
		</p>
	</div>
</div>